<BaseLayout title="Privacy & Cookies — FourthWingDragon Fan Tools" description="How FourthWingDragon handles quiz answers, generated names, clipboard actions, cookies and links to external websites." breadcrumbs={[{name:'Privacy',href:'/privacy/'}]}><h1>Privacy and Cookies</h1><div class="prose"><p>This static website has no accounts, database or login. Quiz answers and generated names remain in the current browser tab. The site does not send them to a server or save them in local storage. Reloading clears quiz progress.</p><p>The quiz URL records the current step, without answers or a personal profile. Share as text and Copy name write to your clipboard only when you select those buttons. They do not post to social platforms.</p><p>Core features use no cookies, analytics tags or advertising trackers. Hosting infrastructure may process standard request logs. Google Search Console ownership is verified with a static HTML file; that file adds no tracking script.</p><p>External destinations, including official author websites and dictionary links, follow their own privacy policies. Read those policies before submitting information there.</p></div></BaseLayout>
